    "body": "Worker check before code. The Wire EDM tool kind part needs a new `ToolKind` variant. It edits `crates/tools/src/tools.rs`, `crates/tools/src/cutting_rows.rs`, `crates/tools/src/catalog_asset.rs`, `crates/app/src/commands/tool.rs` and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tool_icons.rs`.\n\nFour open PRs of `mkinney` edit the same code: #2001 (adds the Waterjet kind), #2026, #2020 and #2029 (stacked on it). A different author owns them, so the worker does not stack on them and does not edit the same lines in parallel.\n\nNo claim was made. No branch or code exists. The Wire EDM tool kind work waits until #2001 merges. Then a worker adds the Wire kind on the new `main`.\n\nFacts for that work:\n- The kind list in `tools.rs` has `Electrode` as the sinker kind.\n- Open question for the PR: where the wire operations read the wire diameter now (machine file or operation parameter). Not yet checked.\n- If the kind changes the kerf that wire operations read, the work is under the safety floor and needs `effort:high`.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
